- These are real tears.

00:00:28.370 --> 00:00:29.427
You are the, oh no.

00:00:29.427 --> 00:00:30.430
- She loves you.

00:00:30.430 --> 00:00:31.263
I'm telling you.

00:00:31.263 --> 00:00:32.120
- Oh my God.

00:00:32.120 --> 00:00:33.320
- [Kelly] No, but here.

00:00:33.320 --> 00:00:36.650
Can I, can I tell you my favorite part?

00:00:36.650 --> 00:00:38.140
Cause I was reading her pre-interview,

00:00:38.140 --> 00:00:39.200
and all the things,

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:40.660
like I've seen you in "Book of Mormon,"

00:00:40.660 --> 00:00:42.760
I've seen you in "Frozen,"
or heard you in "Frozen,"

00:00:42.760 --> 00:00:44.120
all these things you've done.

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:45.974
Tell him what, the one you mentioned?

00:00:45.974 --> 00:00:46.931
- Bear Claw.

00:00:46.931 --> 00:00:47.764
- Bear Claw.

00:00:47.764 --> 00:00:48.600
- Bear Claw.

00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:50.913
- Bear Claw or New Girl, that's her poll.

00:00:54.020 --> 00:00:55.630
- I also loved Wedding Ringer.

00:00:55.630 --> 00:00:56.540
- Oh, thank you.

00:00:56.540 --> 00:00:58.169
You're too young to see that but okay.

00:00:58.169 --> 00:00:59.037
(excited laughter)

00:00:59.037 --> 00:01:00.790
(clapping and laughter)

00:01:00.790 --> 00:01:03.074
- You are so unbelievably talented.

00:01:03.074 --> 00:01:03.907
- Thank you.

00:01:03.907 --> 00:01:05.737
- We were listening to your
song in the car this morning,

00:01:05.737 --> 00:01:09.060
"I Don't Know My Name",
and I'm blown away by you.

00:01:09.060 --> 00:01:09.893
- Thank you.

00:01:09.893 --> 00:01:10.801
- She's so talented.

00:01:10.801 --> 00:01:11.634
- Thank you, I'm blown away by you.

00:01:11.634 --> 00:01:13.700
- You are mesmerizing, really incredible.

00:01:13.700 --> 00:01:15.480
- I love that you're crying it's so cool.

00:01:15.480 --> 00:01:16.760
- I'm not crying, I'm fine.

00:01:16.760 --> 00:01:18.990
It was the initial shock.

00:01:18.990 --> 00:01:20.060
- You shouldn't lose that though.

00:01:20.060 --> 00:01:21.310
I think it's cool when you get so

00:01:21.310 --> 00:01:22.143
excited about meeting people.

00:01:22.143 --> 00:01:24.520
I'm 37 years old, and I
still, ask Meryl Streep,

00:01:24.520 --> 00:01:25.810
I look like an idiot.

00:01:25.810 --> 00:01:28.066
Like, but whatever I
don't care, I like her.

00:01:28.066 --> 00:01:31.140
- Mine was Harrison Ford,
imagine how that went.

00:01:31.140 --> 00:01:32.480
- Oh my god, was he quiet?

00:01:32.480 --> 00:01:34.920
- I literally was like, I love you,

00:01:34.920 --> 00:01:36.343
and he's like alright.

00:01:39.050 --> 00:01:40.270
- So why Bear Claw?

00:01:40.270 --> 00:01:41.140
Why was that your poll?

00:01:41.140 --> 00:01:42.300
- I love New Girl.

00:01:42.300 --> 00:01:43.770
I actually just did an interview with

00:01:43.770 --> 00:01:44.810
Zooey Deschanel.

00:01:44.810 --> 00:01:45.653
- Oh I love Zooey.

00:01:45.653 --> 00:01:47.920
- Because I'm like a
die-hard New Girl fan.

00:01:47.920 --> 00:01:49.940
But they told me on the
phone, they're like,

00:01:49.940 --> 00:01:53.120
Okay so someone's gonna be
sitting with you on the couch,

00:01:53.120 --> 00:01:54.243
and I'm like oh okay.

00:01:56.815 --> 00:01:57.770
And I was like oh who is
it, and they were like

00:01:57.770 --> 00:01:59.760
Josh Gad, and I was like who's that.

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:03.330
So I didn't know who that
was, but I'm like a huge fan.

00:02:03.330 --> 00:02:05.060
But I know you as Bearclaw.

00:02:05.060 --> 00:02:06.760
(laughter)

00:02:06.760 --> 00:02:08.150
- There are so many emotions that

00:02:08.150 --> 00:02:09.322
I'm going through right now.

00:02:09.322 --> 00:02:10.540
(laughter)

00:02:10.540 --> 00:02:13.520
Do you know who you were, then
when I learned who you were,

00:02:13.520 --> 00:02:14.710
I cried.

00:02:14.710 --> 00:02:16.710
- I cried really hard on the phone.

00:02:16.710 --> 00:02:18.780
- I know what you mean though,
because I don't ever know

00:02:18.780 --> 00:02:20.030
everybody's real names sometimes.

00:02:20.030 --> 00:02:23.210
- Especially actors, I don't know actors.

00:02:23.210 --> 00:02:24.530
- Yeah and I always think that they're

00:02:24.530 --> 00:02:26.653
the person they were in
the movie and they're not.

